    {
      "name": "Talkative Intern",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "attribution": {},
        "description": "<p>You are accosted by a talkative intern that is exceptionally interested in your background, the project you are working on an just about anything that might help advance his career at the company.</p><p></p><p>Start a Countdown clock (3).  When the clock reaches 0 you have successfully ditched the intern.  You can advance the clock by :</p><ul><li><p>Making a successful check for an appropriate social skill</p></li><li><p>Mark 1 Stress</p></li></ul><p>While the intern is with you all actions not attempting to address the intern are at disadvantage.</p>",
        "resource": null,
